      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the appellant would submit that this is the appeal against the judgment and order dated 24.12.2022 passed by Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Dehradun whereby the appeals filed by the appellant against the order of the Adjudicatory Officer have been dismissed.",
