        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36521103978157043,
      "_hearing_date": "9_August_2023",
      "_hearing_file": "AO-171-2023 on 9 August, 2023.json",
      "_hearing_offset": 0
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "4. Per contra, learned counsel for the State would submit that as per Section 76 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 before hearing on any of the application, the proposed appellant has to deposit the entire amount of penalty imposed.",
